---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Dental Services in Tempe, AZ"
description: "Complete dental services at 3rd Set Smiles in Tempe, AZ — dental implants, All-on-4 / All-on-X full-arch reconstruction, family dentistry, cosmetic dentistry, emergency care, and more. Led by Dr. Matthew Phillips, DDS."
permalink: /services/
breadcrumb:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Services", url: "/services/" }
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span>Services</div>
    <h1>Complete Dental Care, <span>One Trusted Team</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">3rd Set Smiles is a full-service general, cosmetic, and implant dental practice in Tempe, Arizona. From cleanings, fillings, and crowns to extractions, implants, and dentures &mdash; fixed and removable &mdash; you'll see the same doctor and the same team every visit.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/schedule/" class="btn-primary">Request an Appointment</a>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.telShort }}" class="btn-outline">Call {{ site.phone.display }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# Hub sections are driven by src/_data/serviceCategories.js — one section per
   category, in order. A service appears in the section whose `key` matches its
   serviceMeta.category. Backgrounds alternate (section / section-cream). #}
{% for cat in serviceCategories %}
<section class="section{% if loop.index is even %} section-cream{% endif %}">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-in" style="margin-bottom:36px">
      <h2 style="color:var(--navy)">{{ cat.label }}</h2>
      <p class="muted">{{ cat.blurb }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-list-grid">
      {% for s in collections.services | servicesInCategory(cat.key) %}
        <a class="service-card" href="{{ s.url }}">
          <span class="service-name">{{ s.data.serviceMeta.label }}</span>
          <span class="service-blurb">{{ s.data.serviceMeta.shortBlurb }}</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

{# Safety net: any service whose category key matches no defined category is
   surfaced here instead of silently vanishing from the hub. If this group
   renders, fix the offending service's serviceMeta.category. #}
{% set orphanServices = collections.services | uncategorizedServices(serviceCategories) %}
{% if orphanServices.length %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-in" style="margin-bottom:36px">
      <h2 style="color:var(--navy)">Uncategorized</h2>
      <p class="muted">These services have an unrecognized category and need a valid <code>serviceMeta.category</code> key.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-list-grid">
      {% for s in orphanServices %}
        <a class="service-card" href="{{ s.url }}">
          <span class="service-name">{{ s.data.serviceMeta.label }}</span>
          <span class="service-blurb">{{ s.data.serviceMeta.shortBlurb }}</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section cta-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-in">
      <h2>Not sure which service you need?</h2>
      <p>Tell us what's going on and we'll help you figure out the right next step. Most consultations are quick and there's never any pressure.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="/schedule/" class="btn-primary">Request an Appointment</a>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.telShort }}" class="btn-outline">Call {{ site.phone.display }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
